  "Description": "Gets characters, words, lines or sentences from the input string. Useful for typewriter effects.\n\nThe fragments are joined again with a matching delimiter (none, space, line break or \". \").\n\nSee also: [ReadFile], [RequestUrl], [GetAttributeFromJsonString], [SplitString]",
